Responsibility: Performs arithmetic and logical operations.
Ports: op1 : in std_logic_vector(31 downto 0); op2 : in std_logic_vector(31 downto 0); alu_op_type : in ALU_OP_TYPE_t; result : out std_logic_vector(31 downto 0)

